OL,3,GNEWSACouncil worker's police order for
OL,4,Aprotest flag removal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council employee who drove to the
OL,7,Fsite of a proposed migrant camp in the
OL,8,Fmiddle of the night and removed protest
OL,9,Fflags has been handed a police order.
OL,11,FThe woman, in her 60s, was caught on
OL,12,FCCTV at RAF Barnham where she took down
OL,13,Fbanners at the site where the Home
OL,14,FOffice wants to house almost 1,000
OL,15,Fasylum seekers.
OL,17,FShe was arrested the next day and it
OL,18,Flater emerged she worked for West
OL,19,FSuffolk Council after a parking permit
OL,20,Fwas seen in the window of the car she
OL,21,Farrived in.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
