OL,3,GNEWSACouncil worker's police order for
OL,4,Aprotest flag removal
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuffolk Police said the woman had
OL,7,Faccepted a Community Resolution Order -
OL,8,Fwhich avoids a court appearance but
OL,9,Frequires the offender to admit
OL,10,Fresponsibility. West Suffolk Council
OL,11,Fhas been approached for comment.
